    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm having such a hard time with my knee pain lately. my arthritis is acting up and tylenol just isn't doing anything for it anymore. i'm on xarelto for my afib, but i was thinking about just taking some advil since it's stronger for inflammation. is it okay to mix those two? i really need something that works.",
